msgid ""
"Replace ``SESSION_ID`` below with the ``session_id`` returned by ``session "
"start`` or ``session list``."
msgstr ""
"Zamijenite ``SESSION_ID`` u nastavku s ``session_id`` koji vraća ``session "
"start`` ili ``session list``."

